    "title": "The Universal Language of Harmony",
    "text": "Roman numeral analysis is like having X-ray vision for music. Instead of just seeing chord names, you'll understand harmonic function - why chords work together and how they create emotional movement. This system works across all keys and genres.",
    "columns": [
      { "title": "Key Independence", "text": "Learn patterns once, apply them in any key. I-V-vi-IV works in C major, G major, or any major key." },
      { "title": "Functional Understanding", "text": "See how chords have jobs: I = home, V = tension, IV = departure. Understanding function predicts resolution." }
    ]
  },
